id: chosen-rival
name: Chosen Rival
talentCategory: teamwork
prerequisites: N/A
# (1) "Choose a Character (except a Minion)" - asked as it is gained, any in the world but yourself and Minions; changeable on
# its Options tab.
choose: characterNotMinion
description: >
  There’s one person in your life you strive to surpass more than anyone else, and this drive pushes you to greater heights!
text: >
  Chosen Rival: There’s one person in your life you strive to surpass more than anyone else, and this drive pushes you to greater heights!
  –Prerequisites: N/A
  (1)-[Ruling]: Choose a Character (except a Minion). If that Character has also chosen you through this effect, that Character is your Rival.
  (2)-[Passive]: If your Rival is an Opponent, increase your Wound Rolls by 1(T).
  (3)-[Passive]: If your Rival is an Ally, increase your Soak Value by 1(T).
  (4)-[Passive]: While your Rival is your only non-Defeated Ally in a Combat Encounter, increase your Combat Rolls by 1(T).
  (5)-[1/Encounter]: If your Rival uses the Power Up or Transformation Maneuver, you may immediately use the same Maneuver as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver.

---

[passive]
# (1) Your Rival: the one you chose, if they chose you through it too (conditions.mjs rivalOf). Opponent or Ally by their token
# on the scene against yours - none there, neither.
# (2)
if (rivalOpponent) {
    wound += 1(T);
}
# (3)
if (rivalAlly) {
    soakValue += 1(T);
}
# (4) Your Rival the only one of your Allies on the scene not Defeated.
if (rivalOnlyAlly) {
    combatRolls += 1(T);
}
# (5) Your Rival's Power Up or Transformation: the same, out of sequence, offered to you on its card - once an Encounter,
# counted when taken (chat.mjs superiorSyncOffers).
allow rival.followPower;
